OL,3,GNEWSAConstruction work stops at
OL,4,Awildlife spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are on site and work has stopped
OL,7,Fat a wildlife spot after a High Court
OL,8,Finjunction was imposed to stop
OL,9,Funauthorised construction and caravans
OL,10,Fbeing brought on to the site.
OL,12,FThe injunction was issued at 22:30 BST
OL,13,Fon Saturday to prevent work at a field
OL,14,Foff Sheering Mill Lane in
OL,15,FSawbridgeworth, Hertfordshire, but
OL,16,Fdiggers were seen being used on Sunday
OL,17,Fand Monday morning.
OL,19,FHowever, about a dozen police officers
OL,20,Fentered the site shortly before 09:00
OL,21,FBST and videos and pictures show
OL,22,Fvehicles leaving the field.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
